    <!--
      HOW TO ADD A NEW RELEASE:
      1. Bump MARKETING_VERSION and CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION in Xcode.
      2. Export Framecho.app to ~/Downloads (a Release build; see AGENTS.md).
      3. Run: go run ./cmd/framecho-release
         - Enter release notes when prompted, or run non-interactively with
           flags, e.g.:
             go run ./cmd/framecho-release -yes \
               -notes "Fixed pixelate preview
             Improved upload flow"
           (-notes-file <path> reads bullets from a file instead.)

      The release tool creates Framecho.dmg, signs it with Sparkle, prepends
      this appcast, commits/pushes appcast.xml to main, and creates the GitHub
      release with the DMG attached.

      Newest release goes on top.
    -->

    <item>
      <title>Version 0.41.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>44</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.41.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 05:11:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.41.0</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>编辑记录、录屏项目和背景预设改用 Framecho 自己的文件格式（.framecho / .framechorec / .framechopreset）。升级后首次启动会自动迁移已有文件，旧版导出的 .screendroppreset 预设仍可导入</li>
          <li>升级后请勿退回 0.40.0 及更早版本，旧版本无法读取迁移后的编辑记录</li>
          <li>Intel Mac 导出视频时可以使用 GPU 加速，此前会退回较慢的 CPU 渲染（未经 Intel 实机测试）</li>
          <li>修复 Framecho 改名前录制的视频在编辑器中显示原始文件名的问题</li>
          <li>云端设置指南移除了来自上游服务器的演示视频</li>
          <li>应用声明的最低系统版本统一为 macOS 26.4</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
